+    - Find each orange 4-connected component of size at most 3 and process its pixels independently.
+    - A noise pixel becomes the majority rectangle color among its 4-neighbors if at least two rectangle-colored neighbors exist; ties use the first tied rectangle color encountered on that row, otherwise the noise pixel is erased to black.
